[{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/comments/4027930052","pull_request_review_id":5224949877,"id":4027930052,"node_id":"PRRC_kwDOAO6SJc7wFVXE","diff_hunk":"@@ -365,7 +365,7 @@ class GDScriptByteCodeGenerator : public GDScriptCodeGenerator {\n \t\t\t\ttemporaries.write[p_address.address].bytecode_indices.push_back(opcodes.size());\n \t\t\t\treturn -1;\n \t\t\tcase Address::NIL:\n-\t\t\t\treturn GDScriptFunction::ADDR_NIL;\n+\t\t\t\treturn -1;","path":"modules/gdscript/gdscript_byte_codegen.h","commit_id":"e6568879774d71c156b1f2ae9830b287430ea3b9","original_commit_id":"e6568879774d71c156b1f2ae9830b287430ea3b9","user":{"login":"HolonProduction","id":99511741,"node_id":"U_kgDOBe5tvQ","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/99511741?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/HolonProduction","html_url":"https://github.com/HolonProduction","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HolonProduction/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HolonProduction/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HolonProduction/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HolonProduction/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HolonProduction/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HolonProduction/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HolonProduction/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HolonProduction/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HolonProduction/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"body":"I'd prefer that we flag the compilation as failed if this happens and replace the very few places were it is fine to just write this into bytecode explicitly. (This from my understanding should only be the non returning call opcodes that share a layout with their return counterpart, which are currently written with `append(Address(